WEBVTT

00:09:59.461 --> 00:10:02.543
Todos mis malos hábitos deben irse.

00:10:03.381 --> 00:10:04.532
Roten conmigo.

00:10:04.556 --> 00:10:08.397
(Beatboxing)

00:10:20.292 --> 00:10:21.442
¿Listos?

00:10:22.651 --> 00:10:23.801
Aplaudan conmigo.

00:10:25.705 --> 00:10:32.203
(La audiencia aplaude)